he admin console called it.\n- **Feed paging:** `feed()` only read the first page of results (DynamoDB returns at most 1 MB per call). Once the table grew, stories past that page would have silently dropped out of the feed. It now reads every page.\n\nNothing is committed or deployed.","ttft_ms":2656,"type":"result","duration_ms":70490,"uuid":"62c2568c-2b47-4d46-8d4e-2e163e501c52","ttft_stream_ms":1690,"time_to_request_ms":37,"first_content_frame_ms":1690,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
